<title>NETHERLANDS: VNU SEES HIGHER 1997 NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>VNU SEES HIGHER 1997 NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HAARLEM, Netherlands 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher NV Verenigd Bezit VNU said on Tuesday it expected its net profit and ordinary earnings per share to rise in 1997.</p>
